          "SUBJECT_HEALTHY"
        ],
        "role": "grant",
        "text": "{CHARACTER-1} has raised strong objections to the questionable morals and culture of idleness being spread by the intellectual movement in {CITY-0}. {G1:He:She} demands a stronger hand in keeping the city on the right course.",
