        "text": "As the Dissent Judaism has taken hold in {CITY-0}, a leader has risen who has united the {RELIGION-1,3} against your local forces. {CHARACTER-2} has a reputation as a harsh but effective leader, punishing any who refuse to join {G2:his:her} ranks. \n\nSwift action will needed to be taken if we are to keep {CITY-0} from falling into {CHARACTER-POSS-2} control.",
