            "outcomes": [
              "+1 Happiness level",
              "+60 Civics (scales)"
            ],
            "removes": false,
            "text": "Permit their own rule."
          }
        ],
        "prob": 0,
        "repeatTurns": 40,
        "requires": [
          "SUBJECT_CITY_AUTONOMOUS_RULE",
          "SUBJECT_ADULT"
        ],
        "role": "end",
        "text": "The city of {CITY-0} has been living under its own guidance, away from the rule of {PLAYER-1}.\n\nA council from the city visits soon after hearing of your coronation. They are favorable to your rule and offer to bring the city back under the sway of the crown.\n\nWill you accept this offer, or allow {CITY-0} to keep their Autonomous Rule?",
        "title": "Reclaiming Control",
        "trigger": "Succession Us",
        "url": ""
      },
      {
        "author": "Josh Unsworth",
        "dlc": "",
        "eventLinkPrereq": "EVENTLINK_CITY_ZENOBIA_AUTONOMY",
        "eventLinkTurns": 4,
        "excludes": [],
        "href": "events/on-new-turn-2#EVENTSTORY_CITY_AUTONOMY_EMPRESS",
        "id": "EVENTSTORY_CITY_AUTONOMY_EMPRESS",
        "options": [
          {
            "eventLink": "",
            "grants": false,
            "outcomes": [
              "removes Autonomous Rule",
              "4 rebel units spawn",
              "gains Imprisoned"
            ],
            "removes": true,
            "text": "This experiment has gone far enough."
          },
          {
            "eventLink": "",
            "grants": false,
            "outcomes": [
              "+80 Happiness in the city",
              "gains A Rising Star"
            ],
            "removes": false,
            "text": "Such strong leadership is to be admired."
          }
        ],
        "prob": 0,
        "repeatTurns": -1,
        "requires": [
          "SUBJECT_ZENOBIA",
          "SUBJECT_GOVERNOR",
          "SUBJECT_PLAYER_NO_RISING_STAR"
        ],
        "role": "end",
        "text": "The city of {CITY-0} has been thriving during its autonomous rule, the leadership of {CHARACTER-1} taking the city from strength to strength. A recent economic boom has seen the city minting new coins, with inscriptions that name {CHARACTER-1} an empress, and so an equal to yourself.\n\nIs such hubris to be tolerated?",
        "title": "The Empress of {CITY-0}",
        "trigger": "New Turn",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zenobia"
      },
      {
        "author": "Josh Unsworth",
        "dlc": "",
        "eventLinkPrereq": "",
        "eventLinkTurns": 0,
