            "removes": true,
            "text": "We will take back {CITY-0}, by any means."
          },
          {
            "eventLink": "",
            "grants": false,
            "outcomes": [
              "+20 XP"
            ],
            "removes": false,
            "text": "No, the city has earned its freedom."
          }
        ],
        "prob": 10,
        "repeatTurns": 15,
        "requires": [
          "SUBJECT_CITY_AUTONOMOUS_RULE"
        ],
        "role": "end",
        "text": "The city of {CITY-0} has become renown as a free state of autonomous rule, a land unto itself. The court begrudges the situation, complaining that allowing such freedoms encourages others to expect the same.\n\nThe situation reaches a head when {CHARACTER-1} stands before the court and demands that something be done. {CITY-0} will not return to the fold without the use of force. Shall we fight to regain control?",
        "title": "The End of Autonomy",
        "trigger": "New Turn",
        "url": ""
